Z||000008||p4n1c||05-07-2001||03:22 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fierospeeder:<BR><B>My aunt has the tornado.  Her digital dash is totally out.  Her boyfriend is trying to figure out whats wrong with it.  He's an electrical engineer and said if he had a scematic, he can fix it.  The gm service manual was no hope.  He has a spare digital dash, but not sure if he has tried anything.<P>Is there a place to get schematics of the dash?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Is he sure it's the dash that's the problem?  I know if sensors go, the dash goes.  Our crank sensor went and the dash went nuts for a bit and then the car shut off.  If her car is still running then it's probably either the dash or the sending unit.<P>I'll try looking around the net for it.  If I find something I'll let you know.<P>------------------<BR>-=-=-=[ p4n1c ]=-=-=-<BR>1988 Olds Cutlass Supreme International||||reg||1
